# Affiliate Center — FROZEN (V1 architecture approved)

The Affiliate Center is **architecture-complete** and **frozen until post-launch paying customers**.

**Commission rates:** `docs/BUSINESS_MODEL.md` — Builder Pass + Monthly Build Pro ($29/mo)

## Shipped (do not rework)

- Member UI: `/vault/affiliate` (dashboard, referral link, marketing kit, leaderboard, commissions, resources)
- Admin UI: `/admin/affiliates`
- Mock data + JSON store + `affiliate-repository.ts`
- Supabase proposal: `supabase/affiliate-schema.sql`
- Referral cookie capture on landing (`?ref=`)

## Do NOT implement (Phase 2+ — after paying customers)

- Stripe attribution / Connect payouts
- Payment webhooks for commissions
- Fraud detection
- Payout automation
- Queue systems
- Background jobs
- Redis
- Advanced analytics
- Click tracking service (`/r/[code]`)
