## Allowed changes only

- Critical bugs (broken links, access errors, UI crashes)
- Copy tweaks in marketing kit **data** (not new affiliate infrastructure)
- Business model pricing alignment in constants/mock copy
- Admin content for `affiliate_assets`
- **Manual payout V1** — settings, balance display, admin mark-as-paid (no APIs)

## North star

Product value first. Affiliate Center earns attention **after** Builder Pass buyers complete First Build Mission.

See `docs/AFFILIATE_CENTER.md` for architecture reference.
